billing_state_code.description:
The [ISO 3166-2 state/province code](https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#search/code)
without the country prefix. Currently supported for USA, Canada, India and UAE. For instance, for Arizona (USA), set `billing_state_code`
as `AZ`
(not `US-AZ`
). For Tamil Nadu (India), set as `TN`
(not `IN-TN`
). For British Columbia (Canada), set as `BC`
(not `CA-BC`
). For Dubai (UAE), set as `DU`
(not `AE-DU`
).

